**Potential coalitions:**

Zeltbrin Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span>): [+ weimar_coalition_youg +]%

[? if weimar_coalition < 50 and liberal_reconciliation >= 10: Wide - Zeltbrin Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>[? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?]): [+ zeltbrin_plus_coalition_youg +]% ?]

[? if liberal_reconciliation >= 20: Grand Coalition (<span style="color: #dc0200;">**[+ spd_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span>[? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> ?] ): [+ grand_coalition_youg +]% ?]

Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span>): [+ liberal_coalition_youg +]%

[? if liberal_coalition < 50 : Wide - Liberal Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + others): [+ wide_liberal_coalition_youg +]% ?]

Center-Right Coalition (<span style="color: #48b94a;">GDSU</span> + <span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + <span style="color: #4a9fde;">PPU</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span>  ?][? if blpm_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span>  ?]): [+ center_right_coalition_youg +]%

Right-wing Coalition (<span style="color: #caa58b;">LDP</span> + others + <span style="color: #3F7BC1;">MNVP</span> [? if gnvp_formed = 1 : + <span style="color: #774ae2;">GNVP</span> ?]): [+ right_coalition_youg +]%

[? if anti_democratic_coalition >= 50 : Together, the anti-democratic KPD, DNVP, and NSDAP have a majority in the Reichstag. A stable governing majority will be almost impossible. ?]

